      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the moving cost calculated for packers and movers in kadapa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is derived from a combination of factors: total volume of goods, distance to the destination hub (approximately 850 km), type of packaging required, any special handling for fragile or high‑value items, and optional insurance coverage. Our transparent cost matrix breaks each component down so you see exactly where every rupee goes.</p>
