      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance options are available for goods transported by packers and movers in kadapa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % insured moves under an IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy. You can choose the declared value coverage up to the full replacement cost of your items, with a nominal premium based on the total declared value. Claims are processed within 7‑10 business days after delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need to pay GST on my shifting services, and can I claim it back?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All relocation services are subject to GST as per Indian tax law. The invoice clearly shows the GST amount, which can be claimed as input tax credit if you are a registered business or can be reimbursed by government or corporate relocation budgets that accept GST‑compliant bills.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book a move with packers and movers in kadapa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid ID proof, address proof of both origin and destination, a signed service agreement, and a copy of the GST registration certificate if you are a business. For vehicle transport, registration documents and insurance papers of the vehicle are also required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging system protect my delicate items during the Kadapa‑to‑hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with high‑density bubble wrap for shock absorption, followed by multi‑ply corrugated sheets for structural strength, a weather‑proof stretch film to guard against moisture, and finally custom wooden crates for high‑value or fragile pieces. Each layer is tested for impact resistance, ensuring items arrive intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special regulations or checkpoints on the Kadapa to major hub route I should be aware of?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The route traverses several state checkpoints where e‑Way bills and vehicle permits are verified. Our GPS‑tracked fleet complies with all IBA‑approved standards, and we provide real‑time updates on any hold‑ups, ensuring smooth passage and timely delivery.</p>
